  <dialog id="aboutDialog">
    <form method="dialog">
      <h2>About Orca Web Slicer</h2>
      <p>This page runs the <a href="https://github.com/OrcaSlicer/OrcaSlicer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OrcaSlicer</a>
        slicing engine inside your browser using WebAssembly
        (<a href="https://github.com/Hiosdra/OrcaWeb" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OrcaWeb engine build</a>).
        Your models are sliced on this computer and are never uploaded. The page has no connection to any printer:
        download the G-code and copy it to your printer.</p>
      <p id="aboutVersions" class="hint"></p>
      <p class="hint">OrcaSlicer and this site are licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
        Source code for this site: <a id="sourceLink" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a>.
        Third-party notices are in <a href="NOTICE.md" target="_blank">NOTICE.md</a>.</p>
      <div class="dialog-actions"><button class="primary" value="close">Close</button></div>
